	)
	(text "PS2 is an isolated converter: its output side has its own ground, which becomes the analog ground GNDA of the board.\nEach output passes a filter (100 uF, 2.2 uH, 100 uF) and a fixed regulator. The op-amp rails must stay inside 11.4 ... 12.6 V.\nAt most 220 uF may hang on each module output (YLPTEC datasheet): 2 x 100 uF here."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 27.94 0)
		(effects
